# Foundry's own record of what a script sent. Not the project's record: it is
# rewritten by every run, so `run-latest.json` names whichever contract was
# deployed last rather than the one that is live — ours pointed at a market
# that appears nowhere else in the repository. DEPLOYMENTS.md is the record,
# and every address in it was read back off the chain.
